Bundled font: DejaVu Sans
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
The Synsema binary embeds the DejaVu Sans typeface
(engine/crates/synsema-stdlib/assets/DejaVuSans.ttf) so that SVG text
rasterization (svg_to_png / svg_to_pdf) is deterministic across platforms.

DejaVu fonts are (c) Bitstream, Inc. (Bitstream Vera Fonts Copyright);
DejaVu changes are in the public domain; glyphs imported from the Arev
fonts are (c) Tavmjong Bah. The full license text — whose copyright,
