NumPy ziggurat tables and random-number algorithms
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
engine/crates/synsema-core/src/rng_ziggurat.rs contains the ziggurat tables
of numpy/random/src/distributions/ziggurat_constants.h, and
engine/crates/synsema-core/src/rng.rs reimplements NumPy's SeedSequence,
PCG64 and Generator algorithms so that seeded sequences match NumPy's.

